{
  "version": "v21",
  "base": "v20",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "33C197",
      "english": "(If you don't look at a map of the train route,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 47,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "(Sans consulter le plan du trajet du train,"
    },
    {
      "id": "33C628",
      "english": "(I understand... ",
      "refs": [
        "33C51F"
      ],
      "text_length": 17,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "(Je comprends..."
    },
    {
      "id": "33CA66",
      "english": "<Snowman Clinic>",
      "refs": [
        "20416F"
      ],
      "text_length": 16,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "<Clin. Snowman>"
    },
    {
      "id": "33D42A",
      "english": "Lemme show you how it's done,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 29,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Je vais te montrer comment,"
    },
    {
      "id": "33D71C",
      "english": "With this,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 10,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Avec ça,"
    },
    {
      "id": "33D7BF",
      "english": "With this,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 10,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Avec ça,"
    },
    {
      "id": "33E472",
      "english": "<LIVE HOUSE>",
      "refs": [
        "0F0BC5"
      ],
      "text_length": 12,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "<SALLE ROCK>"
    },
    {
      "id": "33EABF",
      "english": "A suspicious rat, I am",
      "refs": [
        "202F70"
      ],
      "text_length": 22,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Je suis un rat louche"
    },
    {
      "id": "33F0CF",
      "english": "Well, I don't know how far the train goes through,",
      "refs": [
        "33F066"
      ],
      "text_length": 50,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Je ne sais pas jusqu'où va cette ligne de train,"
    },
    {
      "id": "33F9B0",
      "english": "Oh, you don't need anyone's help, ",
      "refs": [
        "33F733",
        "33F738"
      ],
      "text_length": 34,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Tu n'as besoin de personne,"
    },
    {
      "id": "33F9DE",
      "english": "Fine and dandy, ",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 16,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Tout va bien,"
    },
    {
      "id": "347A29",
      "english": "<Who has lost their tail?>",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 26,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "<Qui a perdu sa queue?>"
    },
    {
      "id": "348161",
      "english": "The answer is,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 14,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "La réponse,"
    },
    {
      "id": "348369",
      "english": "Here in Magicant,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 17,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Ici, à Magicant,"
    },
    {
      "id": "348A24",
      "english": "As if scolding a naughty child,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 31,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Comme on gronde un enfant,"
    },
    {
      "id": "348A66",
      "english": "I'm scared!>",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 12,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "J'ai peur!>"
    },
    {
      "id": "3497C1",
      "english": "Have you met a man who says,",
      "refs": [
        "2063B3"
      ],
      "text_length": 28,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "As-tu vu un homme qui dit,"
    },
    {
      "id": "349F05",
      "english": "Just leave me some cash, then with the Goods you can dash.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 58,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Laisse-moi des sous, puis file avec tes objets."
    },
    {
      "id": "34A238",
      "english": "Why not?",
      "refs": [
        "34A09E",
        "34A0A3"
      ],
      "text_length": 8,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Pourquoi"
    },
    {
      "id": "34A6EA",
      "english": "In a bad dream,",
      "refs": [
        "2062F8"
      ],
      "text_length": 15,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Dans un rêve,"
    },
    {
      "id": "34AD51",
      "english": "I know if I don't write things down,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 36,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Je sais que si je ne note pas tout,"
    },
    {
      "id": "34AF1D",
      "english": "The mountain XX Stone,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 22,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "La montagne XX Stone,"
    },
    {
      "id": "34AF9C",
      "english": "Lullaby,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 8,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Berceuse"
    },
    {
      "id": "34EE20",
      "english": "At least,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 9,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Au moins,"
    },
    {
      "id": "351879",
      "english": "Love and peace,",
      "refs": [
        "3517DC",
        "3517E5",
        "3517F0",
        "351800",
        "351809",
        "351812",
        "35181D",
        "35182D",
        "35186C"
      ],
      "text_length": 15,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Amour et paix,"
    },
    {
      "id": "352046",
      "english": "Oh, you must be here because you heard I'm the world's greatest fisherman.",
      "refs": [
        "205ABC"
      ],
      "text_length": 74,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Tu viens sûrement car je suis le meilleur pêcheur au monde."
    },
    {
      "id": "352093",
      "english": "Well, I'm not quite that great...",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 33,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Enfin, je ne suis pas si bon..."
    },
    {
      "id": "3520B7",
      "english": "But, if you've a moment, let me tell you some of my fishing stories.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 68,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Mais si tu as un moment, écoute mes histoires de pêche."
    },
    {
      "id": "352117",
      "english": "It's morning now, ",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 18,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "C'est le matin,"
    },
    {
      "id": "352310",
      "english": "Oh, nothing. ",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 13,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Oh, rien."
    },
    {
      "id": "3523CC",
      "english": "Oh, you're still a kid?",
      "refs": [
        "3523C8"
      ],
      "text_length": 23,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Tu es encore un enfant?"
    },
    {
      "id": "3523E6",
      "english": "Come back when you're older, then.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 34,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Reviens quand tu seras plus grand."
    },
    {
      "id": "352600",
      "english": "If you promise not to do it again, you're welcome to go.",
      "refs": [
        "3525F3"
      ],
      "text_length": 56,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Promets de ne plus recommencer, et tu peux partir."
    },
    {
      "id": "352648",
      "english": "Show me what you have.",
      "refs": [
        "35263F"
      ],
      "text_length": 22,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Montre-moi tes objets."
    },
    {
      "id": "352693",
      "english": "I'll be holding onto this, though.",
      "refs": [
        "352644"
      ],
      "text_length": 34,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Mais je vais garder ceci."
    },
    {
      "id": "352855",
      "english": "Before that,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 12,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Avant cela,"
    },
    {
      "id": "3528E1",
      "english": "I heard that you stepped in dog crap in Yucca?",
      "refs": [
        "3528B9"
      ],
      "text_length": 46,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Tu as marché dans une crotte de chien à Yucca?"
    },
    {
      "id": "352912",
      "english": "That wasn't very cool,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 22,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "C'était pas la classe,"
    },
    {
      "id": "35299B",
      "english": "I don't exactly know what that means, but it doesn't matter.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 60,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Je ne sais pas trop ce que ça veut dire, mais peu importe."
    },
    {
      "id": "3529DA",
      "english": "If you shouldn't judge a book by its cover,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 43,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Si on ne doit pas se fier aux apparences,"
    },
    {
      "id": "352A6A",
      "english": "I have food,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 12,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "À manger,"
    },
    {
      "id": "352AA1",
      "english": "Come on,",
      "refs": [
        "352A33"
      ],
      "text_length": 8,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Allez,"
    },
    {
      "id": "352B17",
      "english": "Here is your medicine.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 22,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Voici ton médicament."
    },
    {
      "id": "352BE7",
      "english": "But we CAN bring peace back to the world.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 41,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Mais on PEUT rendre la paix au monde."
    },
    {
      "id": "352DDA",
      "english": "Thank you for coming back for me.",
      "refs": [
        "205F0D"
      ],
      "text_length": 33,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Merci d'être revenu me chercher."
    },
    {
      "id": "352DFE",
      "english": "If those guys thought I'd skip my revenge over some bruises,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 60,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "S'ils croyaient que des bleus m'empêcheraient de me venger,"
    },
    {
      "id": "352FC3",
      "english": "Get to school!",
      "refs": [
        "2027CD"
      ],
      "text_length": 14,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Va à l'école!"
    },
    {
      "id": "35302F",
      "english": "The rails have been fixed too!",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 30,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Les rails sont réparés aussi!"
    },
    {
      "id": "353253",
      "english": "The train tracks have finally been fixed!",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 41,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Les voies ferrées sont enfin réparées!"
    },
    {
      "id": "3536A8",
      "english": "In exchange for your time,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 26,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "En échange de ton temps,"
    },
    {
      "id": "353795",
      "english": "The rails are fixed,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 20,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Les rails réparés,"
    },
    {
      "id": "353C03",
      "english": "I'm Suzy. ",
      "refs": [
        "2029CB"
      ],
      "text_length": 10,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Moi, Suzy."
    },
    {
      "id": "353CC9",
      "english": "It's too bad that the door to the roof is locked.",
      "refs": [
        "2029DC"
      ],
      "text_length": 49,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Dommage que la porte du toit soit verrouillée."
    },
    {
      "id": "353CFD",
      "english": "Maybe you'd like to join me...",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 30,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Tu pourrais venir avec moi..."
    },
    {
      "id": "353EDA",
      "english": "You're late,",
      "refs": [
        "202910"
      ],
      "text_length": 12,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "En retard,"
    },
    {
      "id": "35401F",
      "english": "But he got away.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 16,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Mais il a fui."
    },
    {
      "id": "3540BE",
      "english": "I'm afraid of what Mr. Teacher will say.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 40,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "J'ai peur de ce que dira le professeur."
    },
    {
      "id": "3541F5",
      "english": "Keep quiet in the library!",
      "refs": [
        "202B85"
      ],
      "text_length": 26,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Silence à la bibliothèque!"
    },
    {
      "id": "354437",
      "english": "You are now cured.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 18,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Te voilà guéri."
    },
    {
      "id": "35444C",
      "english": "Go get hurt again and come back soon. He-he-hee!",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 48,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Va te blesser et reviens vite. Hé-hé-hé!"
    },
    {
      "id": "354502",
      "english": "We can't have students sneaking out to play games",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 49,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Pas question de sécher les cours pour jouer"
    },
    {
      "id": "3545AC",
      "english": "It's no big deal.",
      "refs": [
        "354572"
      ],
      "text_length": 17,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Ce n'est rien."
    },
    {
      "id": "3545C0",
      "english": "The real problem is my wife.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 28,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Le souci, c'est ma femme."
    },
    {
      "id": "3545DF",
      "english": "She sleeps in until noon each day.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 34,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Elle dort jusqu'à midi chaque jour"
    },
    {
      "id": "354604",
      "english": "She won't even pack me a brown bag lunch!",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 41,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Elle ne me prépare même pas mon déjeuner!"
    },
    {
      "id": "3546A1",
      "english": "Then, when she does get up,",
      "refs": [
        "35465D"
      ],
      "text_length": 27,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Puis, quand elle se lève,"
    },
    {
      "id": "3546D4",
      "english": "Luckily,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 8,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Par bol,"
    },
    {
      "id": "35474B",
      "english": "When she was young,",
      "refs": [
        "354747"
      ],
      "text_length": 19,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Dans sa jeunesse,"
    },
    {
      "id": "35477A",
      "english": "Come to think of it,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 20,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "À bien y penser,"
    },
    {
      "id": "354860",
      "english": "You're a pretty good kid.",
      "refs": [
        "3547DD"
      ],
      "text_length": 25,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Tu es un bon petit."
    },
    {
      "id": "35487C",
      "english": "Oh, that's right, you want to go up to the roof.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 48,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Ah oui, tu veux monter sur le toit."
    },
    {
      "id": "3549B9",
      "english": "While you're up there...",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 24,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Une fois là-haut..."
    },
    {
      "id": "3549D4",
      "english": "Make sure to take in the view.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 30,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Profite bien de la vue."
    },
    {
      "id": "354A6F",
      "english": "I won't come out.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 17,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Je ne sors pas."
    },
    {
      "id": "354C86",
      "english": "I need funding for my research.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 31,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Il me faut financer mes études."
    },
    {
      "id": "354CFA",
      "english": "I haven't made any progress since your last visit...",
      "refs": [
        "354C4A"
      ],
      "text_length": 52,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Je n'ai pas avancé depuis ta dernière visite..."
    },
    {
      "id": "354E83",
      "english": "Please drop in anytime.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 23,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Passe quand tu veux."
    },
    {
      "id": "354E9D",
      "english": "I'm always working on a new invention.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 38,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Je travaille toujours à une invention."
    },
    {
      "id": "354FB5",
      "english": "Whatever you do,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 16,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Peu importe quoi"
    },
    {
      "id": "35503A",
      "english": "A success...",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 12,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Un succès..."
    },
    {
      "id": "355133",
      "english": "He's in big trouble if a teacher finds him...",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 45,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Si un professeur le trouve, gare à lui..."
    },
    {
      "id": "35525B",
      "english": "(This factory is Mr. Duncan's private property. Let's see your pass!)",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 69,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "(Cette usine appartient à M. Duncan. Montre ton laissez-passer!)"
    },
    {
      "id": "3552D9",
      "english": "(Sorry, but this is expired, kid.)",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 34,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "(Désolé, il est périmé, petit.)"
    },
    {
      "id": "3552FE",
      "english": "(You swiped it, didn't you?)",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 28,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "(Tu l'as volé, pas vrai?)"
    },
    {
      "id": "35531D",
      "english": "(You're suspicious...)",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 22,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "(Tu es suspect...)"
    },
    {
      "id": "355383",
      "english": "(Scram!)",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 8,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "(File!)"
    },
    {
      "id": "3553EB",
      "english": "Oh, what wonderful news!",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 24,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Quelle bonne nouvelle!"
    },
    {
      "id": "355406",
      "english": "The rails are fixed,",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 20,
      "suffix": "100f",
      "fr": "Les rails réparés,"
    },
    {
      "id": "35551F",
      "english": "The train can't get through until it has been removed.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 54,
      "suffix": "1302",
      "fr": "Le train ne passera qu'une fois cet obstacle retiré."
    },
    {
      "id": "355558",
      "english": "Well, I can't guarantee this train'll go very far, but you still need a ticket to ride.",
      "refs": [
        "3554EF"
      ],
      "text_length": 87,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Je ne garantis pas que ce train ira loin, mais il te faut un billet pour monter."
    },
    {
      "id": "35ABE7",
      "english": "So your house was shaking...",
      "refs": [
        "35AB45"
      ],
      "text_length": 28,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Donc ta maison tremblait..."
    },
    {
      "id": "35AC97",
      "english": "Maybe in your basement?",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 23,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Dans ta cave, peut-être"
    },
    {
      "id": "35B0D9",
      "english": "You should help him come out of his shell.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 42,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Aide-le à sortir de sa coquille."
    },
    {
      "id": "35B189",
      "english": "It's south of Merrysville.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 26,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Au sud de Merrysville."
    },
    {
      "id": "35B319",
      "english": "Why, for example...",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 19,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Par exemple..."
    },
    {
      "id": "35B32F",
      "english": "Some poor girl lost the most adorable hat at Reindeer Station.",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 62,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Une pauvre fille a perdu un joli chapeau à la gare Reindeer."
    },
    {
      "id": "35B417",
      "english": "The train is still stuck, though... Hmm...",
      "refs": [],
      "text_length": 42,
      "suffix": "0300",
      "fr": "Le train est toujours bloqué... Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "id": "35BD03",
